  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Caritas emergency appeal for Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Jerusalem is seeking to provide emergency assistance to the civilian population in Gaza, where the current escalation in conflict with Israel has resulted in the displacement and injury of many thousands of civilians.  Health services within the Gaza Strip are under tremendous pressure.  CAFOD&apos;s grant will assist Caritas Jerusalem to help ensure that life-saving primary and secondary health care can be provided to people in Gaza over the next six months.</narrative>
  </description>
